could be shipped): `. ./defs-a.sh`, `hork__is_converged 2>/dev/null`, `.
./defs-a.sh`, `. ./defs-b.sh`, `hork__is_converged` -- run `dorc why` for the
per-site detail (the apply runs each anyway, to stay safe)
